Feature Refinement Note

HERO-66604   POS - Print Variable - Add Print Variable to Capture Extra Information for Payment Member

Status: Final — version-01 — 2026-07-15

Regional / PO / support export (sections 1–9). Developers use refinement-functional (full note, sections 1–12).

1. Summary (target of the enhancement)

Add printing variables so payment member extra information can appear on guest check and receipt when a payment tender has a member profile linked — alongside existing check-member extra information.

This enhancement uses a new payment / payment-member extra info loop. Under that loop, the same printing variables as check-member Extra Info apply: MemberExtraInfoKey and MemberExtraInfoValue.

It does not rely on resolving payment-member Extra Info only inside the existing CheckMemberExtrainfos loop as originally described in JIRA.

In scope: Guest check and receipt.

Out of scope: Kitchen slip and action slip.

