3. Detailed workflow

Workflow: Print guest check / receipt with payment-member extra information

Availability: Guest check and receipt

Restrictions: Visibility controlled by print format (payment-member extra info loop + MemberExtraInfoKey / MemberExtraInfoValue conditions)

- Operator prints guest check or receipt using the existing print flow.

- 【New】 When the print format uses the payment-member extra info loop, the slip can print MemberExtraInfoKey and MemberExtraInfoValue for the payment member linked to each applicable payment (same variables as used for check-member Extra Info).

- Existing check-member Extra Info printing continues as today (unchanged by this ticket for the check-member path).

